{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0eb584d15c32d9fff22c924f023a6f20b4292f4de364a71bdf55a90e8740cde6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The binary-re plugin relies on radare2, Ghidra, GDB, and QEMU for hypothesis-driven ELF analysis across ARM64, ARMv7, and x86_64."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a3bc70f454faed6412c3f84621b845dc5f4b8289c4991103006c79d7b7ee1867"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Native Claude Code installation uses '/plugin marketplace add 2389-research/claude-plugins' followed by '/plugin install <plugin>@2389-research'."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b3edc6e7356fbf196323c375ff47fe6508351c9179b362c1d562d50b700d7cba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The speed-run plugin uses a hosted LLM (Cerebras) for token-efficient parallel code generation, claiming about 60% token savings, and includes an MCP server."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0eb584d15c32d9fff22c924f023a6f20b4292f4de364a71bdf55a90e8740cde6","clm_a3bc70f454faed6412c3f84621b845dc5f4b8289c4991103006c79d7b7ee1867","clm_b3edc6e7356fbf196323c375ff47fe6508351c9179b362c1d562d50b700d7cba"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_a67d5047774e4ae09777c5a0106f2425","id":"pg_6536cae9659c52e1b6a77b9a153693e3","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-claude-plugins-docs-llms-txt-017d34612ebf-7b9a153693e3.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_5e0e386c395c5a7c81685ba8017d392b"],"title":"2389-research/claude-plugins/docs/llms.txt @ 017d34612ebf","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a67d5047774e4ae09777c5a0106f2425"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1276ffb54e4b6331b803d996ab074d2565f301e8cbf03d0f3c2592d4fc0abd83"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: a manual testing checklist covers auto-detection, sub-skill routing, TodoWrite checklists, correct tool use (Read, Edit, Write, Grep), and output format."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5ffeacd238e9e66ec3ac2078cc8f66e39d8f483f8ea73120274975deb9275860"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills are defined in SKILL.md markdown files with YAML frontmatter containing a name and a description used for auto-detection."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9afb7575a6f2604fac857d102c0d280dd985a9605f32b3feaca1c1ecae041022"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: skill authoring guidance requires granular TodoWrite items (2-5 minutes each), complete runnable code examples, and exact file paths rather than vague references."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c2083a220943671988732b903870f908fc87a3a9ca3faeb6e857176ad30bbb22"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The css-development and firebase-development plugins use a main orchestrator SKILL.md plus sub-skill directories (e.g., create-component, validate, refactor; project-setup, add-feature, debug)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cbad277d11aa5beb31b33f70cedd99d942b51f055853150bf9894e34b7e5c41c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: after modifying a skill, contributors copy it into ~/.claude/skills/, test manually against tests/integration scenarios, and verify auto-detection, TodoWrite checklists, and step ordering."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d4e0b0b632a3adb7cc9c1085183f87f44e2bea3ea8f7506840d0b3eb4d5b9d09"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"All Firebase patterns are centralized in the main firebase-development SKILL.md (1323 lines), and sub-skills reference them via '@firebase-development/pattern-name' syntax."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f93c4b67dac4fbe0eb8cd8f9c8d4bf5c1d0d7c42b988e07a7fdad30c40b83110"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Key CSS patterns include semantic class naming, Tailwind composition with @apply, dark mode by default, and static plus component-rendering test coverage."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1276ffb54e4b6331b803d996ab074d2565f301e8cbf03d0f3c2592d4fc0abd83","clm_5ffeacd238e9e66ec3ac2078cc8f66e39d8f483f8ea73120274975deb9275860","clm_9afb7575a6f2604fac857d102c0d280dd985a9605f32b3feaca1c1ecae041022","clm_c2083a220943671988732b903870f908fc87a3a9ca3faeb6e857176ad30bbb22","clm_cbad277d11aa5beb31b33f70cedd99d942b51f055853150bf9894e34b7e5c41c","clm_d4e0b0b632a3adb7cc9c1085183f87f44e2bea3ea8f7506840d0b3eb4d5b9d09","clm_f93c4b67dac4fbe0eb8cd8f9c8d4bf5c1d0d7c42b988e07a7fdad30c40b83110"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_a67d5047774e4ae09777c5a0106f2425","id":"pg_864d11fb808b5a35b8880ebeff89e727","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-claude-plugins-docs-development-md-017d34612ebf-0ebeff89e727.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_51aa2609c6805ea88a967845b632fa2f"],"title":"2389-research/claude-plugins/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md @ 017d34612ebf","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a67d5047774e4ae09777c5a0106f2425"}
